    """Records the character range of `needle` (as it appears JSON-escaped
    in the originally pasted text) so the Rewriter tab can highlight it.
    Advances a cursor left-to-right so repeated/duplicate needles line up
    with the edit that actually failed."""
    if not self.raw_text or not needle:
